  "totalBlocks": 44,
  "translatedBlocks": 39,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab199cd0aa2f59b7",
      "translationZh": "披露：这篇文章的结构和措辞是在 AI 助手的帮助下完成的。所有数字都来自我自己的运行结果和日志。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f303d2734258c3d",
      "translationZh": "我花了一晚调整 llama.cpp 的路由器预设，并在整个过程中进行了测量。有些发现也适用于我的配置之外的环境，所以在这里分享出来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3bf7c7fa82eb8bb5",
      "translationZh": "RTX 5090（PCIe 5.0 x8，同时负责桌面显示）+ RTX 3090（PCIe 4.0 x8）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d367fd8c318b175",
      "translationZh": "Linux（Kubuntu 26.04 LTS），从源码构建的 llama.cpp（CUDA 13.4），构建版本 0.4.1-dev（build 11028，commit 972d2313b），使用预设 INI 文件的路由器模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2bb7467b963de336",
      "translationZh": "模型（Unsloth）：Qwen3.8-27B UD-Q6_K 和 Q8_0，Qwen3.8-Flash-Next UD-Q4_K_XL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "954ef2dd946a7d36",
      "translationZh": "启用 flash-attn，KV 缓存使用 q8_0，单流，在 27B 上启用 MTP 推测解码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29bec5c758ba76ba",
      "translationZh": "专家位于 RAM 中的 MoE 在 lazy-mode 下出现回归问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70776d4636ab7ede",
      "translationZh": "最近的构建版本即使在禁用 mmap 的情况下，也会延迟映射大型嵌入表。在将专家卸载到 RAM（n-cpu-moe）的 Flash-Next 上，这会导致预填充性能大幅下降。同一份 20.6k-token 文档，ubatch 4096，其余条件完全相同：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f08d1f861668653",
      "translationZh": "lazy-mode 开启 + load-mode mmap",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "272cb2bdeda0f2eb",
      "translationZh": "lazy-mode 关闭 + load-mode mmap",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59b8efb5bab072d1",
      "translationZh": "lazy-mode 关闭 + load-mode none",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb0d2274d9241b46",
      "translationZh": "在 lazy-mode 开启 + mmap 的基础上使用默认 ubatch（512）时，我的速度约为 300 t/s。在 Flash 预填充期间，nvtop 显示 5090 的接收速率约为 28 GiB/s，已经使 Gen5 x8 链路饱和。每个微批次都需要通过 PCIe 传输专家权重，这限制了预填充性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f5c25ca4ef2bfe15",
      "translationZh": "对于卸载的 MoE，ubatch 的影响远大于 n-cpu-moe",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77235f2e4629e311",
      "translationZh": "在 32k 预设下，ubatch 2048 → 4096：941 → 1,234 t/s（+31%）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1c16280e5de49cc4",
      "translationZh": "将另外 2 个专家层移回 GPU：+3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30a1be5d4614a056",
      "translationZh": "更大的微批次意味着每个 token 所需的权重传输次数更少。注意，n-cpu-moe 卸载的是最前面的层，而这些层位于第一张设备上。调低它会增加 CUDA0 的负载，而不是第二张显卡的负载。要利用第二张显卡的空闲显存，先调整 tensor-split，让它向第二张卡倾斜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4a4e1605df5e25d",
      "translationZh": "在 2-GPU 按层拆分配置下，batch-size = ubatch-size 会使流水线执行失效",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f40478b888aae2ec",
      "translationZh": "27B Q8 拆分到两张显卡上，完全驻留于显存，使用同一份 33k 文档：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db8f8ae1c8396ba6",
      "translationZh": "当每个批次只有一个微批次时，两张 GPU 会先后工作，而不是重叠执行。将 batch 保持为 ubatch 的 3–4×。这与第 2 点的情况相反，那里瓶颈在于 PCIe，而不是 GPU 间的重叠执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be20d9168dba35c7",
      "translationZh": "对于 27B，单独使用 5090 比拆分到两张卡上更快",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6365150e549eba48",
      "translationZh": "单独在 5090 上运行 Q6：预填充 2,766 t/s，解码 ~100 t/s（33k 文档）。在两张卡上拆分运行 Q8：2,687 t/s / 69.5 t/s。量化规格并不相同，但显然是 3090 限制了拆分运行的速度。我现在默认在 5090 上以 128k 上下文运行 Q6，只在 >128k 时才使用双卡拆分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ccec0d7853cb9fd7",
      "translationZh": "在 262k 上下文下，计算缓冲区会分配到第二张显卡上",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36e06ddb065bd55b",
      "translationZh": "在 262k 上下文、ubatch 2048 下使用 Flash 时，因在 CUDA1（3090）上分配 7.1 GiB 的计算缓冲区而失败。计算缓冲区的大小随 ubatch × 上下文长度增长。解决方法：在 262k 下将 ubatch 保持为 1024，或使用能够容纳 ubatch 2048 的 128k 预设。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f61f88a9ef2e2c64",
      "translationZh": "MTP：draft 3 是最佳平衡点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4be99701e9ba282",
      "translationZh": "在 27B 上，spec-draft-n-max 从 2 → 3：解码速度提升 +12%（61.9 → 69.5 t/s）。设为 4：提升 +<1%，接受率降至 ~58%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58cf7adb624f4b59",
      "translationZh": "按任务类型划分的接受率（27B Q6，5090，draft 3）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bae2a3f44a4d8614",
      "translationZh": "任务 上下文 解码 MTP 接受率",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83e946ec8fe3394f",
      "translationZh": "数值推理（税额计算，给定规则）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "824323cd02bc7872",
      "translationZh": "代码（含思考，生成了 24.8k 个 token）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06a34e7ed8c62fe0",
      "translationZh": "摘要，Pillar Two 指令",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc7f7ace85b3de4d",
      "translationZh": "因此，这并不只是摘要任务造成的现象。解码速度主要取决于上下文长度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f34906f58248dda",
      "translationZh": "长文档（完整文档放入上下文，生成20条要点摘要）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b506bce09d55a6cf",
      "translationZh": "TTFT = 服务端预填充时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd64984325ac747d",
      "translationZh": "预设 文档词元数 预填充 TTFT 解码 输出 总计",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1132d3922f00efc4",
      "translationZh": "Flash Q4，两块 GPU，128k",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804b94cf11816007",
      "translationZh": "Flash Q4，两块 GPU，262k",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc31cc9fd82e0fcd",
      "translationZh": "这些运行从缓存中复用了约 ~5k 词元的 Open WebUI 系统提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0e451dd8a1501b2",
      "translationZh": "从 61k 增加到 97k 时，27B 的预填充性能下降了 18%（注意力计算成本随上下文增长），Flash 则仅下降了 6%（它受限于 PCIe，而 PCIe 与上下文无关）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3d4c0ac1e8ac681",
      "translationZh": "Open WebUI → llama.cpp 路由器，文件以完整文档形式发送（不是 RAG）。计时数据来自 llama-server 日志和 Open WebUI 的信息面板（prompt_per_second、predicted_per_second、draft_n_accepted）。每次运行都新建聊天，每次加载预设后发送一次预热请求（无论加载模式如何，加载后的首次请求都很慢）。除 lazy-mode A/B 对比外，均只运行一次；在该对比中，我重复运行了最佳配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
